# Produtivo core

React Native CLI 0.86 + TypeScript + styled-components + React Navigation 7 + Firebase Auth/Firestore. Do not introduce Expo, Expo Router, Next.js, Tailwind, or Shadcn.

Read `AGENTS.md` and `Plano-de-Contexto.md` before structural changes.

- Screens live in `src/Pages/{Name}/index.tsx` + `styles.tsx`.
- Shared UI in `src/Components/{Name}/`. Agent docs are `AGENTS.md`; the in-app tab is `src/Pages/IA`.
- Keep the five life categories (`trabalho`, `estudos`, `saude`, `lazer`, `descanso`). Every task must have one.
- Filter lists by `selectedDate` (`YYYY-MM-DD`). One day at a time. Calendar is a date shortcut, not the product.
- Do not commit, push, or add dependencies unless asked.
- If folder, Firestore path, or scope is unclear, ask first.
